# 037 P5: what scripts/verify_skills_startup.ail prints when startup is not refused. The fixture is real_entry.sh's a2 workdir with one skill (alpha) and the profile probe (extensions.order = [skills]).
# command: AILANG_FS_SANDBOX=<workdir> AILANG_RELAX_MODULES=1 ailang run --caps Net,AI,SharedMem,IO,Env,Clock,FS,Process,Stream,Trace,Rand --ai-stub --entry main scripts/verify_skills_startup.ail -- <workdir> probe   (HEAD 3b8494a54fcd74962455a9c670e9b15183718e55)
